          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 12.1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri eegi boojiani gale kaani guyya kud'ani afreeso, ka jia qara, jila Pasaka tolfate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaaloleefi worri Lawi ch'ufti qulqullo, wonti akanatiifi worri qara durati ufi qulqulleese. Worri Lawi hori sorio Pasaka ufifi qaaloleefi worra eegi boojiani gale kaani jed'e qale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami sorio suni nyaate worra Israeli ka eegi boojiani gale kaanifi, nama aada hamtu gosa lafa suni keesa teetu lakise AABBO Waaqa Israeli kad'achu d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya torba ch'ufa worri jila Qit'a bukho inqamne gammadani tolfate. Wonti worri gammadeefi, waan AABBO Waaqi hayyu Ashuru worraa naasise, innileeni ijaarsa Mana Waaqa Israeli keesa worra qarqaareefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Ezrani Yerusalemuni bahe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
